{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLEEP TERROR is an adventure-exploration horror game in which you travel through your nightmares. Travel through different places and dreams, explore and use tools and items found on the maps to help you escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8cb20854f8cb3f423edb001103676608.poster.avif?t=1770218784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8cb20854f8cb3f423edb001103676608.webm?t=1770218784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8cb20854f8cb3f423edb001103676608.mp4?t=1770218784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dreams and watch out for monsters and other dangers. Explore maps and look for clues that may prove crucial to understanding the mechanics of the level and completing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/d346e00633edf801ce4e29005f613ca0.poster.avif?t=1770218784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/d346e00633edf801ce4e29005f613ca0.webm?t=1770218784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/d346e00633edf801ce4e29005f613ca0.mp4?t=1770218784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>ENTITY:</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some maps are exploration-based, but the vast majority contain entities that are waiting for you. The game has a built-in microphone system, so some of them will be able to hear you through your microphone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/ffc8d1cab71a4a62095381667fc53f24.avif?t=1770218784\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras_big/ffc8d1cab71a4a62095381667fc53f24.avif?t=1770218784 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>VHS:</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS filter - a combination of grain, chromatic aberration, and a few other effects. Provides a camera filter like in Backrooms. You can turn it off with a single click during gameplay or when selecting a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/9d7c5bd9444c7fe7ddbbf9bb405912d5.poster.avif?t=1770218784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/9d7c5bd9444c7fe7ddbbf9bb405912d5.webm?t=1770218784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/9d7c5bd9444c7fe7ddbbf9bb405912d5.mp4?t=1770218784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse/Rich Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS FILTER</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization for weaker devices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI that hears you through your microphone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-launch support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter eggs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/3fa50cafc2e6a4124a84495fd73ed665.avif?t=1770218784\" width=131 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADD THE GAME TO YOUR WISHLIST SO YOU DON'T MISS THE RELEASE! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.poster.avif?t=1770218784\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.webm?t=1770218784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/ba3d3df0495b3ea379f3bb02e61c3aa2.mp4?t=1770218784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2879710?t=1770218784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/31b106b31e07d3077bd1b250c36de236901dee05/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770218784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/96f7a1ccc0cb0a32fd845138025894757d79b4d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770218784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/96f7a1ccc0cb0a32fd845138025894757d79b4d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770218784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLEEP TERROR